  "knowledge": "Series Title Uniformity Flag",
  "description": "Checks whether all content entries in the same series share the same canonical name.",
  "definition": "If every title in a series uses the exact same name, it\u2019s marked as 'True'. If they don\u2019t match, it\u2019s marked as 'False'."
